      "text": "Intact-link candidate: validate N3,N4,N5,N6,N7,N8 at ticks 0,1,2,3,4,5. Request individuals N2,N3,N4,N5 at ticks 0,1,2,3; bulk at tick 5 selects N6,N7; request N8 individually at tick 6. Predicted deliveries are N2-N5 at ticks 1-4 and N6-N8 at ticks 6-8. Six actions; both outputs reach eight. This is a finite-model prediction, not observed execution."
