      "text": "Closest rival: use routine bulk at ticks 0 and 1 with the same validation order. Each includes stale N1, producing duplicate deliveries at ticks 1 and 3. Seven required new recognitions cannot then fit into eight available delivery slots. Compare distinct recognitions and wasted slots, not bulk throughput."
