      "text": "The existing connection transfers P1 registration eligibility into P2 request eligibility. A true ablation would withhold only newly completed registrations from P2 while P1 still registers and P2 still requests and delivers initially registered N2. No available control performs that intervention; it would alter fixed request eligibility. Disabling either clerk is a parent-only control, never link ablation."
