      "text": "Compare predicted final (registrations,recognitions): intact candidate (8,8); broken connection (8,2); co-present functional parents with no transferred registration eligibility (8,2); P1 alone (8,1); P2 alone (2,2). Broken and disconnected co-presence conditions are diagnostic counterfactuals outside executable constraints, not completed trials."
